        {
          "text": "Gidioni aruma barume mu ngulu cha Efuraimu choosi khuboola ali, “Yiikha mwiche mupane ne Bamidiani. Tiila kamafubukho ke luluuchi lwa Yoritani ne chinjichi khukhwola e Beti-bara khuliinda Bamidiani bakhambukha tawe.” Baefuraimu be siseecha balaangwa alala, mala batiila luluuchi lwa Yoritani ne chinjichi khukhwola Beti-bara. ",
          "type": "text",
