        {
          "text": "Baamba babaami babili ba Midiani Orebu ne Seebu, berera Orebu a lwanda lwa Orebu, ne Seebu niio bakhamululilanga Endali eya Seebu. Bachiililila khutimania Bamidiani. Bareera kimirwe kia Orebu ne Seebu khu Gidioni owaba ne ali ebukwe owa Yoritani.",
